economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/mahindra-amp-mahindra-among-5-stocks-showing-white-marubozu-pattern/slideshow/135758580.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135758410,imgsize-216766.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/mahindra-amp-mahindra-among-5-stocks-showing-white-marubozu-pattern/slideshow/135758580.cms</guid><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 11:59:25 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[FIIs are back! Jefferies lists 11 stocks that can be the biggest beneficiaries]]> </title><description><![CDATA[In November, foreign institutional investors unexpectedly shifted to become net buyers of Indian equities, indicating a noteworthy change in market dynamics. Jefferies has pinpointed 11 stocks poised to gain from this influx, including heavyweights like Reliance Industries, HDFC Bank, and Axis Bank, which previously faced notable outflows. With positive macroeconomic signals and attractive valuations, this trend could very well continue driving share prices upward. ]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/fiis-are-back-jefferies-lists-11-stocks-that-can-be-the-biggest-beneficiaries/slideshow/135758277.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135757408,imgsize-709578.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/fiis-are-back-jefferies-lists-11-stocks-that-can-be-the-biggest-beneficiaries/slideshow/135758277.cms</guid><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 11:24:56 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[From SpaceX to Anthropic, markets have a new playbook for mega-share debuts]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Anthropic is gearing up for its highly anticipated IPO, aiming to raise as much as $64.4 billion with share prices ranging from $70 to $78. The company is targeting inclusion in major indexes soon after its debut, which is expected to boost passive investments. Sim